SUMMARY:16th Annual Mud Creek Arts and Crafts Festival
LOCATION:Commercial Street\, centered at 106 Commercial Street NE\, Hance
 ville\, AL
DESCRIPTION:Historic downtown Hanceville fills with handmade crafts\, gif
 ts\, food trucks and bounce houses for the kids. Admission is free\, the 
